%[text] 2. Can you find a set of parameters where an initial infection dies out without infecting the entire population, e.g.,  ![An SIR plot where infections initially spread but then settle down with 60% of the population immune and 40% of the population susceptible in a steady state.](text:image:613a)? \
ShowSIRModel(betaVal, gammaVal, S0Val, I0Val, tRange, totPop)
